@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userId = replace-with-user-id
@page = 1
@limit = 10

### ADMIN: list users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### ADMIN: search users by name or email and filter by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=matthew&role=EMPLOYEE&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### Assign user role (ADMIN only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}
